/Title (This program explores how artificial intelligence is influencing school children today, examining both its benefits and challenges. It begins by introducing the rapid growth of AI tools in education and how students are using them for homework, research, exam preparation, and creative projects. The discussion then highlights the positive impacts, such as personalized learning, instant doubt clarification, improved productivity, and better understanding of complex subjects. At the same time, it addresses concerns including over-dependence, reduced critical thinking, cheating risks, and data privacy issues. The program concludes by analyzing the future of AI in schools and emphasizes the importance of responsible and balanced AI usage.)
